abap-cleaner-vscode-port

This repository is a TypeScript re-implementation ("port") of a subset of the
cleanup rules and VS Code integration behavior of ABAP cleaner, an
Eclipse/Java plugin originally developed by SAP:

    https://github.com/SAP/abap-cleaner

ABAP cleaner is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its original
copyright notice is reproduced here as required by Section 4(d) of that
License:

    Copyright 2023 SAP SE or an SAP affiliate company and ABAP cleaner
    contributors

No code from the original Java/Eclipse plugin is compiled, executed, or
distributed by this repository; the upstream source (vendored locally as a
read-only, git-ignored behavioral reference under `reference-eclipse-plugin/`
during development) is used only to determine the intended behavior of each
ported rule. Every ported TypeScript file carries its own header comment
naming the upstream Java file and version it was ported from (see
`spec/03-engine-port.md`), and implements only a narrowly-scoped,
independently-tested subset of that file's behavior — see each rule's header
comment and `spec/08-roadmap.md` for the exact scope and what remains
unported.

